sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor K as Keeper
    participant S as Settler

    K->>S: refund(orderId, originData)
    S->>S: status = orderStatus[orderId]
    alt status not in {Opened, Closing}
        S-->>K: revert Settler__OrderInTerminalState
    end
    S->>S: abi.decode → orderData; _orderDigestMemory == orderId (else Settler__OrderIdMismatch)
    S->>S: block.timestamp > fillDeadline (else Settler__NotExpired)
    alt !allowPartialFills AND exactFill.premiumFired
        S-->>K: revert Settler__PremiumAlreadyFiredRefundBlocked
    end
    S->>S: orderStatus[orderId] = Refunded
    S-->>K: emit: OrderRefunded(orderId)
    Note right of S: No tokens move at Settler. Async dstCST escrow remains reachable via reclaim after the deadline.
